WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.555
The sea moves the heat.

00:02.255 --> 00:05.830
The colours are the temperature of the sea, measured from orbit.

00:06.280 --> 00:16.698
Water warmed in the tropics does not stay there: currents such as the Gulf Stream carry it towards the poles, and it gives up heat and water to the air on the way.

00:17.148 --> 00:20.727
Most of the water in the air was lifted off a warm sea.
